meta {
  name: 03_MaskinportenActivityLog
  seq: 3
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Scenario: A Maskinporten scope delegation is recorded in the Maskinporten activity log only

    Given the consumer has no supplier relation to the supplier
    And the consumer adds the supplier
    And the consumer delegates a Maskinporten scope resource to the supplier
    When the consumer reads the Maskinporten log of access it has given
    Then the supplier relation and the resource are recorded as created
    And the supplier sees the same events in the log of access it has received
    And the events are not in the consumer's connections log
    And the suppliers read scope does not read the access received
    And the supplier cannot read the consumer's log
    When the consumer removes the supplier
    Then the removal of the relation and the resource is recorded
}
